spice
* MOSFETs and Current Sources
M1 3 2 0 0 NMOS ; M1 (drain
M2 5 2 0 0 NMOS ; M2 (drain
M3 3 1 4 4 PMOS ; M3 (drain
M4 5 1 4 4 PMOS ; M4 (drain
M5 1 1 4 4 PMOS ; M5 (drain
M6 5 1 4 4 PMOS ; M6 (drain
M7 0 2 0 0 NMOS ; M7 (drain
M8 4 2 0 0 NMOS ; M8 (drain

* Current Source
Iss 0 3 DC ; Iss connected between source of M1, M2 to ground

* Voltage Definitions
VDD 4 0 DC ; DC voltage source for VDD
Vb1 2 0 DC ; DC voltage source for Vb1
Vin 2 0 DC ; DC input for Vin

* Outputs
Vout1 1 0 ; Output Vout1
Vout2 5 0 ; Output Vout2
